        "original_id": "984c535f-3fed-5cf6-a5f2-5cf7874dd29a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sean Dyche, Malky Mackay\n- Organizations: Watford F.C., Burnley\n- Roles: Assistant manager, manager, professional footballer\n- Events: Managerial appointments, departures\n\nFacts:\n- Sean Mark Dyche was born on 28 June 1971 and is an English former professional footballer.\n- Sean Dyche was assistant manager of Watford F.C. before becoming the club's manager in July 2011.\n- Sean Dyche became manager of Watford F.C. in July 2011 following the departure of Malky Mackay.\n- Sean Dyche has been the manager of Burnley since October 2012.\n- Burnley plays in the Premier League.",
